:: MP NPC Ash Extra Hub [nobr]
<<set $outside to 1>><<set $location to "forest">><<effects>><<mpAmbient>>
这里把日常、出门与其他人情往来收在一处，免得主页面堆太多条目。
<br><br>
<<getouticon>><<link [[回Ash身边 (0:02)|MP NPC Ash Hub]]>><<pass 2>><</link>>
<br><<socialiseicon>><<link [[聊聊日常 (0:03)|MP NPC Ash Daily Hub]]>><<pass 3>><</link>>
<br><<mphearticon>><<link [[一起出门 (0:03)|MP NPC Ash Date Hub]]>><<pass 3>><</link>>
<br><<investigateicon>><<link [[人情往来 (0:03)|MP NPC Ash Social Hub]]>><<pass 3>><</link>>
<br><<link [[更多近况 (0:03)|MP NPC Ash More Hub]]>><<pass 3>><</link>>

